L["Increases your melee attack power in Cat, Bear and Dire Bear Forms by 50% of your level."] = "Erhöht Eure Nahkampfangriffskraft in Katzengestalt, Bärengestalt und Terrorbärengestalt um 50% Eurer aktuellen Stufe."
