L["Reduces the mana cost of your Frost spells by 5% and reduces the threat caused by your Frost spells by 10%."] = "Verringert die Manakosten Eurer Frostzauber um 5% und verringert die von diesen Zaubern verursachte Bedrohung um 10%."
